---
export const prerender = true;

import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Unsubscribe" description="Opt out of marketing communications from SecureLoan.">
  <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-4xl px-4 py-16">
    <article class="glass-card p-8 prose prose-slate max-w-none text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Unsubscribe</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mb-6">Last Updated: March 1, 2025</p>

      <p>You can opt out of receiving marketing communications from SecureLoan at any time. We honor all opt-out requests promptly in compliance with the CAN-SPAM Act, the Telephone Consumer Protection Act (TCPA), and applicable state laws.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">Email Unsubscribe</h2>
      <p>To stop receiving marketing emails from SecureLoan:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Click the <strong>"Unsubscribe"</strong> link at the bottom of any marketing email you received from us, <strong>or</strong></li>
        <li>Email us at <strong>unsubscribe@secureloan.example.com</strong> with the subject line "Unsubscribe" and include the email address you wish to remove.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Requests are processed within <strong>10 business days</strong>. You may still receive transactional or service-related emails related to any active inquiry you have submitted.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">SMS / Text Message Opt-Out</h2>
      <p>If you have consented to receive SMS marketing messages, you may opt out at any time by replying <strong>STOP</strong> to any text message you receive from us. You will receive a confirmation message and no further texts will be sent.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">Phone / Calls Opt-Out</h2>
      <p>To opt out of telemarketing calls, email us at <strong>privacy@secureloan.example.com</strong> with "Do Not Call" in the subject line, or write to us at the address below. We will add your number to our internal do-not-call list within 30 days.</p>
      <p>You may also register with the National Do Not Call Registry at <strong>donotcall.gov</strong> or call 1-888-382-1222.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">Third-Party Lenders</h2>
      <p>If you have been contacted by a third-party lender after submitting a request through our platform, you must contact that lender directly to unsubscribe from their communications. SecureLoan cannot unsubscribe you from lenders' lists on your behalf.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">Contact</h2>
      <p><strong>SecureLoan</strong><br/>
      123 Financial District Ave, Suite 400, New York, NY 10005<br/>
      Email: unsubscribe@secureloan.example.com</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
